{% endif %}## Quickstart

```bash
gh repo clone {{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}
cd {{ project_name }}
uv sync --all-groups          # creates .venv from .python-version and uv.lock
# GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM hides a system-level core.hooksPath, which pre-commit refuses to install over.
GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 uv run pre-commit install   # ruff, mypy, basedpyright, bandit, pip-audit, tests, diff-cover
uv run pytest -qq
```
